DESCRIPTION:Historic Blakeley State Park runs a cruise into the upper reac
 hes of the Mobile-Tensaw Delta that explores the Tensaw River and Mifflin
  Lake. The winding waterway sits between the Tensaw and Middle rivers and
  is home to a lot of wildlife. It is a short distance from what was once 
 an international boundary between the United States and a Spanish colony.
